-tatras"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Rysy","type":"trail","detail":"Climb from the Slovak side and you stand on the highest point in Poland. Chains on the upper section, a full and demanding day.","season":[7,8,9],"evidence":{"n_sources":4,"of":15,"urls":["https://www.earthtrekkers.com/hike-high-tatras-of-slovakia-how-to-plan-your-visit/","https://zannavandijk.co.uk/hiking-in-slovakia/","https://www.farawayworlds.com/guides/hiking-in-the-high-tatras"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Tatranska Magistrala","type":"trail","detail":"The traverse that runs the length of the range, about 45 km, three to four days, and easy to sample for an afternoon between two cable car stations.","season":[6,7,8,9],"evidence":{"n_sources":4,"of":15,"urls":["https://www.lonelyplanet.com/articles/out-on-a-high-exploring-slovakias-high-tatras","https://www.farawayworlds.com/guides/hiking-in-the-high-tatras","https://www.bigworldsmallpockets.com/high-tatras-slovakia-travel-guide/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Skiing at Tatranska Lomnica and Strbske Pleso","type":"activity","detail":"The two main winter resorts. The same lift system runs for non skiers who just want the height.","season":[12,1,2,3],"evidence":{"n_sources":4,"of":15,"urls":["https://www.bigworldsmallpockets.com/high-tatras-slovakia-travel-guide/","https://blog.gopass.travel/en/high-tatras-slovakia-cable-cars-summer/","https://www.hotelpanorama.sk/en/aktivity/tatranska-lomnica"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Belianska Cave","type":"activity","detail":"The only show cave in the High Tatras open to visitors, on the range's eastern edge.","evidence":{"n_sources":3,"of":15,"urls":["https://www.kempinski.com/en/grand-hotel-high-tatras/overview/destination/things-to-do","https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attractions-g285716-Activities-Vysoke_Tatry_Presov_Region.html","https://www.thewalkingparrot.com/post/what-to-visit-in-high-tatras"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Ś